  "job_B3.4.3_20251003_114737": {
    "text": "Ic eow bidde, leofe men, \u00fe\u00e6t swa ofte swa ge faren bi ricre monn\u00e6 burines \u00fe\u00e6t ge sceawi\u00e6n & asmegen\nHwi.\nNyte ge \u00fe\u00e6t all \u00fe\u00e6t tofar\u00e6\u00f0 & toglit, swa swa monnes sceadu d\u00e6\u00fe?\n& heore world\u00ferym, swa rice, gedw\u00e6scte, & gedwan, & aidlode, & afulode?\nAc loca \u00feenne on \u00fea burignes & s\u00e6g to \u00fee sylfum, Hw\u00e6t.\n\u00de\u00e6s mon iu on \u00feissre worlde wunsumlice lyfede \u00fee ic \u00e6r cu\u00f0e.\n\u00deenne magon \u00fea \u00f0yrle ban us l\u00e6ren, & \u00fe\u00e6s deaden duste of \u00feare burignes to us cw\u00e6\u00f0on wolden, gif heo\nO\u00f0er to hwam \u00feu on oferhydo \u00fee sylf up ah\u00e6fst on ofermetto, & on un\u00feeaw\u00e6s, & sunne to swy\u00f0e\nBeheald me, & onscyne \u00feine yfel\u00e6 \u00feonc\u00e6s, & ongit \u00fee sylfum.\nSceawe mine ban her on \u00feissere molde, & bi\u00feeng \u00fee sylfen.\nIu ic w\u00e6s swylce \u00feu nu eart, & gyt \u00feu iwur\u00f0\u00e6st swulc ic nu eom.\nGeseoh mine ban & mi dust & forl\u00e6t \u00feine yfele lust\u00e6s.\n\u00deenne, leofe men, \u00feeah \u00fee \u00f0a deade ban of \u00feare burignes specon ne magon, \u00feeah we magen us sylf\u00e6n\nBe\u00feence we eac \u00e6fre \u00feone ended\u00e6g \u00feissre worlde, \u00fe\u00e6t is domes d\u00e6g, \u00feonne Drihten mid \u00feam\n\u00deenne aris\u00e6\u00fe of \u00feam ealde burignes alle \u00fea lichame & \u00fea ban, \u00fee f\u00e6le geare \u00e6r deade on swefete l\u00e6gen\n& \u00feenne aris\u00e6\u00fe all moncynn tog\u00e6dere, & heo \u00feenne iseo\u00f0 \u00feas world sweligende, mid fure brastlende &\n\u00deonne cym\u00f0 \u00fee so\u00f0fest\u00e6 dem\u00e6 of heofen\u00e6s wolcnum, & he by\u00f0 ymb\u00ferung\u00e6n mid \u00feam heofenlice\n& he s\u00e6t \u00fea so\u00f0fest\u00e6 on \u00feam swi\u00f0ere healfe, & \u00fea synfulle on \u00feam wunstren healfe, & he \u00feenne s\u00e6\u00f0 to\n& \u00feider ge beo\u00f0 ibrohte mid murige lofsongum, & \u00fe\u00e6r ge beo\u00f0 mid me wuniende on heofene rice\n\u00de\u00e6r eow nan wi\u00f0erweardnes ne der\u00e6\u00f0, ac on sundfulnesse \u00fe\u00e6s brihte lihtes ge \u00fe\u00e6r bli\u00fee wuni\u00e6\u00f0, for\nAlle ic heom eft iseah last on eowre gode weorcum, swa ic heom \u00e6r s\u00e6de.\n\u00deenne sy\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6n bisih\u00f0 Drihten to \u00feam synfull\u00e6n monnum & \u00feus to heom cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gewit\u00e6\u00fe, ge awarigede,\n& \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fea scyldige b\u00e6rn\u00e6\u00fe, & \u00fea wurm\u00e6s heom mid weallende mu\u00f0es forswolge\u00f0; & heor\u00e6 ansyne bi\u00f0\n\u00deenne \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fee \u00fea manfulle beo\u00f0 isceofene wepende on \u00fe\u00e6t ece fyr, \u00fe\u00e6r heo on pine & on ece\n& \u00fea \u00f0\u00e6r cume\u00f0 \u00fee her man wrohten & Godes lare iheren nolden.\nHeo beo\u00f0 bisencede on \u00fea hate lig\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r heo \u00ferowi\u00e6\u00f0 on ecere seorege.\n\u00deenne far\u00e6\u00fe \u00fea halige men & \u00fea so\u00fefeste mid swege to life, ant samod si\u00fei\u00e6\u00f0 mid engl\u00e6 werod to \u00feam\n\u00deenne is us mucel neod, leofe men, \u00fe\u00e6t we Godes bodu georne healden & earni\u00e6n \u00fe\u00e6t we moten mid\nFor \u00feam \u00fee we iseo\u00f0 \u00feis l\u00e6ne lif mid fr\u00e6cednesse & mid mycele earfo\u00f0nesse ifulled, & ylce d\u00e6g \u00feis lif\nAl moncyn is ilice on \u00feas weorld icenned, \u00feeah heore lif beo sy\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6n unilic; & heo \u00e6ft on ende alle\nNe nan swa longe her on weorlde ne leof\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t eft \u00fee dea\u00fe hine ne genime, & \u00fea modig\u00e6n & \u00fea\n& \u00fe\u00e6t heo her for Godes lufe syllen nolden heor\u00e6 sawle to h\u00e6lpe, heo hit r\u00e6dlice forl\u00e6te\u00f0, & o\u00f0re\nAc \u00feenne \u00fee dea\u00fe cym\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feenne sceolen heo forl\u00e6ten heor\u00e6 \u00e6ht\u00e6 heor\u00e6 un\u00f0anc\u00e6s, & heo his \u00feenne\nYlce d\u00e6g \u00feis andwearde lif won\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fee we lufi\u00e6\u00f0, ac \u00fea pine ne woni\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feam monnum \u00fee heom nu \u00e6fter\nUton we \u00feenne, leofe men, \u00feas \u00feing alle gemunen & i\u00feencean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t mennisce lichame is swa\nSwa eac \u00fe\u00e6s monnes geoge\u00fe\u00e6 & fegernes d\u00e6\u00fe.\n\u00deenne \u00feeo \u00e6lde on him sig\u00e6\u00f0 mid unh\u00e6le, all \u00feare geoge\u00f0e fegernes aweg awit & forwur\u00f0.\nAc Cristes ansyne is to lufigenne ofer alle o\u00f0re \u00feing mucele swi\u00f0or \u00feenne \u00fees lichames geog\u00e6\u00f0had.\nAc habb\u00e6\u00fe eowre heorte on \u00feisse eor\u00felice gewinne & earni\u00e6\u00fe eow \u00fe\u00e6t heofenlice rice, \u00fe\u00e6r is ece\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feurst, ne hungor, ne wop, ne teo\u00f0e gegrind, ne mor\u00feer, ne man; ne \u00fe\u00e6r nan ne sw\u00e6lt\u00e6\u00f0,\nAc \u00fe\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6s hest\u00e6n kynges kynerice, & \u00fe\u00e6r wuni\u00e6\u00fe alle \u00fea \u00fee Godes bodu heolden on ece murh\u00f0e;\nHw\u00e6t we magen bi \u00feissum undergyt\u00e6n & icnawon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee Almihtig Drihten nele \u00fe\u00e6t mon his gefen\u00e6\nNe \u00feearf us na tweogean \u00fe\u00e6t he us n\u00e6le eft \u00feare l\u00e6na munegi\u00e6n \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he us her on weorlde to forl\u00e6t.\n\u00c6fre swa he us merlucor gyf\u00f0, swa we him swi\u00f0e \u00feonci\u00e6n sceolen; & swa \u00ferymlicor ar, swa beo \u00fe\u00e6r\n\u00deam \u00f0e Drihten mycel syl\u00fe, myceles he him eft \u00e6t bidd\u00e6\u00fe; & \u00feam \u00fee he her on worlde mucel to\n\u00c6ghwylc heah ar her on worlde bi\u00f0 mid frecednesse bewunden; & swa \u00feeo ar bi\u00f0 mare, swa beo\u00fe \u00fea\nBe \u00feam we wull\u00e6\u00f0 eow sume bysne s\u00e6cgen: \u00fe\u00e6t treow \u00fee weaxe\u00f0 on \u00feam wude be ar up ofer alle \u00fea\nEac \u00fea heahg\u00e6 torr\u00e6s & clif\u00e6s \u00fee heag\u00e6 stonde\u00fe ofer alle o\u00fere eor\u00f0\u00e6, heo eac \u00fee mare rune nim\u00e6\u00f0,\nSwylce eac \u00fea heag\u00e6 munt\u00e6s & dun\u00e6 \u00fea \u00f0e heage stond\u00e6\u00fe & torri\u00e6\u00f0 ofer alne midd\u00e6neard;\nSwa eac \u00fea heag\u00e6 miht\u00e6 her on worlde f\u00e6ll\u00e6\u00f0 & dros\u00e6\u00f0 & to lure wur\u00f0\u00e6\u00fe.\n& \u00feisre weorlde wel\u00e6 wur\u00f0\u00e6\u00fe to soreg\u00e6.\n\u00deeah we us scryd\u00e6n mid \u00feam r\u00e6deste golde & mid \u00feam hwiteste seolfre, & we mid \u00feam fegereste\n\u00deenne beo\u00f0 \u00fea wel\u00e6n & \u00fea gleng\u00e6 agotene, & \u00fee \u00ferym tobrocen & \u00fea gymm\u00e6s toglidene, & \u00fe\u00e6t gold\nFor \u00feam nis \u00feissere weorlde wlite noht, ne \u00feisses middaneardes fegernes, ac he is hwilwendlic, &\nSwa swa ricu beo\u00f0 her on worlde.\nHw\u00e6r beo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6 rice caseres, & \u00fea kyng\u00e6s, \u00fee we iu cu\u00fe\u00e6n?\nHw\u00e6r beo\u00f0 \u00fea ealdormen \u00fee boden setten?\nHw\u00e6r is domer\u00e6 domselt?\nHw\u00e6r beo\u00f0 heor\u00e6 ofermedo, buton mid molde be\u00feeaht, & on wite wr\u00e6cen?\nWa by\u00f0 weorldscryftum buton heo mid rihte r\u00e6den & t\u00e6cen.\nSwa bi\u00f0 eac \u00feam l\u00e6w\u00e6de monnum, buton heo heore scriffte lusten & her\u00e6n, & \u00fea halige lare healden.\nHw\u00e6r com middaneardes gestreon?\nHw\u00e6r com weorlde welen?\nHw\u00e6r com folce fegernes?\nHw\u00e6r comen \u00fea men \u00fee geornlucost eahte tyloden, & o\u00ferum eft yrfe l\u00e6fden?\nSwylc bi\u00f0 \u00feeo oferlufe eor\u00felice gestreon\u00e6.\nEfne heo bi\u00f0 smeke ilic, o\u00f0\u00f0e r\u00e6n\u00e6s scur\u00e6s, \u00feonne heo of heofenne swi\u00f0ost reose\u00f0, & ra\u00fee eft\nSwa wace & swa tealte beo\u00f0 eor\u00f0lice dreames, & swa wace beo\u00f0 eaht\u00e6 mid monnum.\nSwa bi\u00f0 tod\u00e6led lichame & sawle, \u00feenne heo bi\u00f0 of \u00feam lichame il\u00e6d; & bi\u00f0 sy\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6n ful uncu\u00fe hu \u00fee\n\u00d0enne nis us nan \u00feing b\u00e6tere ne s\u00e6lre, buton \u00fe\u00e6t we lufien ure Drihten mid alle mode, & mid alle\nSwa hit bi \u00feam iwriten is, \u00fee \u00f0e his Drihten luf\u00e6\u00f0, & his bene to him sende\u00fe, he iher\u00e6\u00f0 him eafre, &\nSwa Crist sylf s\u00e6de, \u00fea \u00f0e to me cerr\u00e6\u00f0 from heor\u00e6 gylt\u00e6s, & heor\u00e6 synn\u00e6 andedt\u00e6\u00f0 on mine nome,\nIc sylle for \u00feisse eor\u00felice swinke \u00fe\u00e6 heofenlice reste, & for \u00feisse l\u00e6ne rice, \u00fea heofenlice gife; & for\nEal\u00e6, iselige beo\u00f0 \u00fea men \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t rice lufi\u00e6\u00f0; & unl\u00e6de beo\u00f0 \u00fea \u00f0e him wi\u00f0sac\u00e6\u00f0.\nHw\u00e6t frem\u00e6\u00fe \u00feam men, \u00feeah he al midd\u00e6neard on his agene \u00e6ht istreone, gif \u00fee deofel nim\u00e6\u00fe eft his\nO\u00f0\u00f0e hw\u00e6t, \u00feeah he libbe her on life a \u00feusend wintr\u00e6?\nAl hit bi\u00f0 him unnyt, gyf he \u00e6fter his dea\u00fee bi\u00f0 into h\u00e6lle il\u00e6dd, & \u00fe\u00e6r on pine wun\u00e6\u00f0 a buton ende.\nUton we wenden us nu to \u00feam beter\u00e6 & cerr\u00e6n to ure Drihten, & him georne iher\u00e6n, & his bodum\n& secea we ure chyrce\u00e6n mid cl\u00e6nnesse, & \u00fe\u00e6r georne lyst\u00e6n \u00feare halg\u00e6 lare.\n& \u00feerinn\u00e6 nane spece ne sp\u00e6ken, buton \u00fe\u00e6t we mid stilnesse ure bedu sing\u00e6n, & earni\u00e6n us \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00de\u00e6r is Kynges \u00ferym isyne, & \u00fe\u00e6r is feger engl\u00e6 werod, & apostola song, & Godes lof, & \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00deer \u00fea so\u00f0feste men scin\u00e6\u00f0 swa sunne, & men rixi\u00e6\u00f0 swa engl\u00e6s on heofene rice.\nWe beo\u00f0 ihatene & ila\u00f0ode to \u00feam halige hame & to \u00feam kynelice fri\u00f0stole, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0e Almihtig Drihten\nAmen.",
